                <mxCell id="auth-kv" value="&lt;b&gt;Postgres KV store (direct path)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;API namespace rewrite and worker scope both use (&amp;lt;identity&amp;gt;, career_agent, &amp;lt;area&amp;gt;). Checkpoint/state access has a thread ownership gate. Identity is resolved per call, not at singleton construction." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#172B4D;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#F3F6FA;strokeColor=#D6E0EB;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=18;fontSize=15;" parent="1" vertex="1">
